<p>From Scottsdale and Paradise Valley to Silverleaf, DC Ranch, and North Phoenix luxury, Arizona is a warm-contemporary desert-modern market that increasingly specs handleless European fronts and flat-slab design — a high-margin niche that most local showrooms can't serve well. As Pinnacle's home base and part of our <a href="/territory/arizona">core 10-state territory</a>, Arizona is where we can support a dealer most closely. Carrying Pronorm lets your studio own the German-kitchen conversation in your market, pairing seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless design with the authenticity of a true German manufacturer.</p>

